    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.files\n\n### Description\n\nIt would be great to easily be able to toggle the preview on and off. I didn't see any documentation on how do it. I thought I could be mapped to `p` as part of the default mappings perhaps.\n\nI'd be happy to contribute if this sounds like a good idea.",
    "closed_at": "2025-01-23T09:01:40Z",
